@ 37.1.2.1.2 - Cayuga to Lower Cayuga
# citation: cedh audmanh, from Julian, Charles (2010), “A History of the Iroquoian Languages”, University of Manitoba, Winnipeg
	ts > t / _(h)r
	t > k / _j
	V > V[-voiced] / _h “(odd syllables only)”
	tʔ tsʔ kʔ kʷʔ > tʼ tsʼ kʼ kʷʼ
	# “Allophonic changes:”
	s > ʃ / _{r,j}
	t k kʷ > d ɡ ɡʷ / _{V,R} ! _V[-voiced]